    "name": "Client-Server Interface",
    "description": "## Backend Tests\n\nThis collection contains backend API tests for a **redistricting/VRA appeal analysis application**, targeting a locally running server at `http://localhost:8080`. It validates endpoints that power the application's GUI use cases across two U.S. states — **Georgia** and **Delaware**.\n\n### Structure\n\nThe collection is organized into two folders:\n\n- **State** — Requests that retrieve high-level state data, including ensemble summaries, state detail, and congressional representative information for Georgia and Delaware.\n    \n- **Graphs** — Requests that fetch visualization data, including Box & Whisker plots, Scatter plots (Gingles analysis), Ecological Inference (EI) analysis, and ensemble splits.\n    \n\n### Endpoints Covered\n\n| Endpoint | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `/api/state/{state}/ensemble` | Ensemble summary (number of district plans, population equality threshold) |\n| `/api/state/{state}/detail` | Detailed state-level data |\n| `/api/state/{state}/representatives` | Congressional representative summary and table data |\n| `/api/state/{state}/boxWhiskers` | Box & Whisker plot data |\n| `/api/state/{state}/gingles` | Scatter plot data for Gingles analysis |\n| `/api/state/{state}/eiAnalysis` | Ecological Inference analysis data |\n| `/api/state/{state}/ensembleSplits` | Ensemble split data |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "48983540"
  },
